    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73299" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁλοσχέρ-εια</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>general survey</i> or
				<i>estimate,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				2.1.24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Corn.
				<u>ND</u>
				20
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθ᾽ ὁλοσχέρειαν</span> in
				<i>general terms,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαλέγεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1.251
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i> ; 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ ὁλοσχέρειαν,</span> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ μέρη,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				10.53
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>lumpiness, solidity,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				8.24.34
			</span></i>.</div>
